# Cattle details are cached in Mongo; clear the cache first when checking the upstream call.

### Get cattle details
GET {{host}}/api/cattle/{{cattleId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$guid}}
Accept: application/json

> ../asserts/Should_be_200_OK.js

### Get cattle details (unknown ear tag)
GET {{host}}/api/cattle/UK999999999999
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-cdp-request-id: {{$guid}}
Accept: application/json

> ../asserts/Should_be_404.js
